WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
The Duskbloods is coming. The rumors are already loud.

00:07.400 --> 00:12.600
This archive keeps only what is confirmed, not rumor presented as fact.

00:15.200 --> 00:20.200
After the Network Test: six Bloodsworn, one land, Lowanro City.

00:23.800 --> 00:30.600
Confirmed. Test-build only. Player-reported. Unconfirmed. Four labels, used in public.

00:32.200 --> 00:37.200
Guides for the match, the characters, the systems. Sourced, dated, checked.

00:39.800 --> 00:43.000
Duskbloods Archive. Open the desk.
